WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The parts: printed tray, flex sensor board, piezoresistive textile, bump sheet.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Press the sensor board into the tray.

3
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Lay the textile on top.

4
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Press on the bump sheet. It self-aligns to the board.

5
00:00:49.000 --> 00:01:08.500
Plug the cable tail into the readout board.
